name 'ai-generated-design-preassessment-q7_2025'

question 'A fashion store\'s website looks great on a computer, but when customers open it on their phones, the images overlap and the text is too small to read. What design issue is causing this problem?'

wrong 'The colors don\'t match the store\'s brand identity.'
wrong 'The site uses too many images, slowing it down.'
right 'The website isn\'t responsive to different screen sizes.'
wrong 'The website doesn\'t have enough interactive features.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

